#: ../../source/module/settings.md:1 36883caa221b41c29d84c67c6f8911f2
msgid "设置（Settings）"
msgstr "Settings"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:3 f79815b335ea4150b1f1227e8aefb76e
#
msgid ""
"`设置` 用来调整界面语言、显示、导入导出、NEP "
"后端和绘图样式。刚开始不需要全部改；只有当你遇到加载慢、显示卡顿、预测慢、导出格式不符合下游要求，或想切换 CPU/CUDA 后端时，再来这里。"
msgstr "Use `Settings` to adjust the interface language, rendering, import and export behavior, the NEP backend, and plot styles. You do not need to tune everything at first. Come here when loading is slow, rendering stutters, prediction is slow, exports do not match downstream requirements, or you need to switch between CPU and CUDA."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:5 c3aa2399bd7c4116b49e450be5835cd5
msgid "先改哪些"
msgstr "Choose the relevant setting"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md bf327ffb74dd4361abacb0d8cc1b3ecc
msgid "你遇到的问题"
msgstr "What you observe"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 0f19744e645a4b1e975e1f7bd30db3fb
msgid "可以看哪个设置"
msgstr "Setting to check"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md e80ae8bbb86f4f3e9412faec4e19a10b
msgid "影响"
msgstr "Effect"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md d9ba06bf3f8d40789ba5e86f46aad3fc
msgid "想把界面换成中文或英文"
msgstr "Switch the interface between English and Chinese"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md ebde059242da472db41204cde387052e
msgid "`语言`"
msgstr "`Language`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 241dc119a33f4fa4ac6d585b63cc2f7b
#
msgid "在 `Auto` / `English` / `中文` 间切换，重启后生效"
msgstr "Choose `Auto`, `English`, or the Chinese option; takes effect after restart"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 398283e1f4ef442b9ec12cf0d2c09705
msgid "大结构显示卡顿"
msgstr "Large structures render slowly"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 459961a7e46c4011b62baa9075e838e8
msgid "`绘图后端`"
msgstr "`Canvas Engine`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 241dc119a33f4fa4ac6d585b63cc2f7b
msgid "在 `Auto` / `PyQtGraph` / `VisPy` 间切换结构和散点渲染后端"
msgstr ""
"Switch the structure and scatter rendering backend among `Auto`, "
"`PyQtGraph`, and `VisPy`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 22cee334d1554dac901594df0002f75b
msgid "力图数值不符合习惯"
msgstr "Force plots use an unfamiliar scale"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 7d6f38c6413f4aa39c6d66bdab045377
msgid "`力数据格式`"
msgstr "`Force data format`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md acb8b6cccd0448c9816311ceee53c0ba
msgid "在原始力和归一化显示之间切换"
msgstr "Switch between raw-force and normalized display"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 7887cdc60bca4034a9a658e78ba04a20
msgid "打开目录时不想自动加载"
msgstr "Opening a directory should not trigger automatic loading"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 29aa561c599a47b084998ea0e4fd4f0b
msgid "`自动加载`"
msgstr "`Auto loading`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 3de2d4cc27e04c6a8ef51c1dce850e48
msgid "控制是否自动读取启动路径里的相关结果文件"
msgstr ""
"Control whether related result files in the startup path are loaded "
"automatically"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 7db53c0bd6ba48ea99e64776eb550a18
msgid "卡片处理时原子顺序影响观察"
msgstr "Atom order makes card outputs difficult to inspect"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 1d317489098a49e999f2d6a43f47c553
msgid "`原子排序`"
msgstr "`Sort atoms`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 584646719fcb4401a667c7120f52dc10
msgid "处理结构时按元素顺序重排原子"
msgstr "Sort atoms by element while processing structures"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md cf9369be847645d99fa1f2033fa9e951
msgid "卡片菜单太拥挤"
msgstr "The card menu is crowded"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md c83c15f020d54b4fa37458a54647f861
msgid "`使用卡片分组菜单`"
msgstr "`Use card group menu`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 4e21819f798a45788ece3d88f51a89ad
msgid "按卡片 `group` 分组显示构建数据集菜单"
msgstr "Group the `Make Dataset` menu by card `group`."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 7d463922d2864d5ab06f57b12b2beac2
msgid "反复打开同一批输出较慢"
msgstr "Reopening the same outputs is slow"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 60f1cd90e2e94ea4a2a0d4300dc734a4
msgid "`缓存输出文件`"
msgstr "`Cache output files`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md ef49549f52aa494abf153fadbcfa3a39
msgid "缓存 `*.out` 和 `descriptor.out`，减少重复解析"
msgstr "Cache `*.out` and `descriptor.out` files to avoid repeated parsing"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 3120969c570e4f33b45cdeb2a920bf2f
msgid "导出小数位不合适"
msgstr "Exported numeric precision is unsuitable"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md ba39dff5634b4b2bbc03b4a04c21b397
msgid "`导出有效数字`"
msgstr "`Export significant digits`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 84a98f2c841a437db9258cb35ea7bbcd
msgid "控制 `xyz` / `extxyz` 中逐原子数值的有效数字"
msgstr "Set the significant digits for per-atom values in `xyz` and `extxyz`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 808608968f7145b3a912842c47b6d4db
msgid "源文件没有 `Config_type`"
msgstr "Source structures have no `Config_type`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 808608968f7145b3a912842c47b6d4db
#
msgid "`默认 Config_type`"
msgstr "`Default Config_type`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 3b1d32425d7a4f158240430a62921888
msgid "给缺少标签的结构补默认来源标签"
msgstr "Assign a default provenance label when one is missing"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 3d3665107ae34be08d1c5d11d00912f1
msgid "非物理结构检测太松或太严"
msgstr "Nonphysical-structure detection is too permissive or too strict"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 9d60d633afda4c41b7818f18e7b42b10
msgid "`共价半径系数`"
msgstr "`Covalent radius coefficient`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md c6dff77e2bf4405c8a663e9c37ddc251
msgid "调整近邻距离判据"
msgstr "Adjust the nearest-neighbor distance criterion"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:20 00b2eeb553a54fcfaf589cbe0e63666b
msgid ""
"DeepMD 的标准/Mixed 格式和标准 NPY 的 `Config_type`/化学式分组方式已移到 `NEP 数据集查看` "
"的导出弹窗。程序会记住上次选择，但它们不再占用通用设置页。"
msgstr ""
"The standard/Mixed DeepMD format choice and the standard NPY grouping "
"choice (`Config_type` or chemical formula) have moved to the `NEP Dataset"
" Display` export dialog. The program remembers the last selections, but "
"they no longer occupy the general Settings page."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:23 22471dec30aa455cb7dbc502eb89fa3b
msgid "界面语言"
msgstr "Interface language"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:25 d2bf2f593690495ea8f5f8ab2aec9e1c
msgid "在 `个性化` → `语言` 中选择："
msgstr "Choose under `Personalization` → `Language`:"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:27 e66a702c07364a5bb3fb1aaca9bb38d9
msgid "`Auto`：跟随系统语言；系统是中文时显示中文，其他情况显示英文。"
msgstr "`Auto`: follows the system language; Chinese systems show Chinese and all others show English."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:28 a4f8130bba8746c8b7da13911b14ce7c
msgid "`English` / `中文`：固定使用该语言。"
msgstr "`English` or the Chinese option: always use that language."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:30 e49c48ad2b1e4b83a617bd86c2e8b8b8
msgid ""
"保存后需要重启 NepTrainKit 才会生效。本文档按中文界面的按钮名称编写；如果你使用英文界面， "
"请切换到英文文档，按钮名称会与界面一致。在软件里点击卡片的文档链接时，也会按当前界面语言打开对应版本。"
msgstr "Restart NepTrainKit for the change to take effect. This English documentation uses the English interface labels; if you use the Chinese interface, switch to the Chinese documentation so the button names match. Documentation links inside the application open the version that matches the current interface language."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:33 aba45e62e40c49be9499fe11318d70eb
msgid "NEP 后端"
msgstr "NEP backend"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:35 4da3c1ec87c24f1eb0b3a20f43c614b1
#
msgid "`NEP 后端` 控制预测时使用 CPU、CUDA，还是由程序自动选择。"
msgstr "`NEP Backend` controls whether prediction uses CPU, CUDA, or automatic backend selection."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:37 ac08e03578744024b286ad712a461904
msgid "`Auto`：默认路径；CUDA 可用且当前模型受支持时使用 CUDA，否则在任务开始前明确提示并使用 CPU。运行中不会静默切换后端。"
msgstr ""
"`Auto`: the default path. It uses CUDA when available and supported by "
"the current model; otherwise it explains the decision before the task "
"starts and uses CPU. It does not silently switch backend during "
"execution."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:38 fa9f6fd0a2544ef0b301eb7169917558
msgid "`CPU`：适合没有可用 GPU、驱动不匹配，或只是少量结构快速查看。"
msgstr ""
"`CPU`: use when no compatible GPU is available or when inspecting only a "
"few structures."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:39 ac9a23cbc9f54bc78dfb3e9b3457c72f
msgid "`CUDA`：明确要求 NVIDIA CUDA 后端；不可用时直接报错并说明驱动或安装问题。"
msgstr ""
"`CUDA`: explicitly require the NVIDIA CUDA backend. If unavailable, the "
"application reports the driver or installation problem instead of "
"changing backend."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:41 d5823f91e8104bcaa42bafa5dd87451e
#
msgid ""
"`NEP 分块最大原子数` 决定一次预测分块包含的总原子数，CPU 和 CUDA 使用相同语义。遇到显存或内存不足时调小；单个结构本身超过 "
"CUDA 可用规模时应改用 CPU，因为单结构不能安全拆分。"
msgstr "`NEP Chunk Max Atoms` sets the total atom count allowed in one prediction chunk, with the same meaning on CPU and CUDA. Reduce it when device or host memory runs out. If a single structure exceeds what CUDA can handle, use the CPU instead, because one structure cannot be split safely."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:43 1c29ec7ca29942c591166da2c21610fc
#
msgid "`数据精度` 控制导入 DFT/结构数据后的存储精度。常规可保持默认；只有在内存压力明显或需要保留更高精度数值时再改。"
msgstr "`Data Precision` controls the storage precision of imported DFT and structure data. Keep the default for normal work; change it only for clear memory pressure or when higher precision must be preserved."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:45 960cfe88d8084936975213f6d0155ce5
#
msgid ""
"`NEP 设置` 中的 `运行环境状态`会显示 NepTrainKit 原生辅助模块、`nep-adapters` 版本以及 CPU/CUDA "
"可用状态。点击 `NEP 运行时更新` 可以从 PyPI "
"手动检查兼容更新。每次打开软件后也会在后台执行一次运行时检查：没有更新或网络检查失败时保持静默，发现新版本时弹出安装提示。程序会校验 wheel "
"的 SHA256，并在独立进程中确认导入和 CPU 后端可用后才切换版本；更新在重启 NepTrainKit 后生效。验证失败时继续使用原版本。"
msgstr "`Runtime health` under `NEP Settings` reports NepTrainKit's native helper modules, the `nep-adapters` version, and CPU/CUDA availability. Click `NEP runtime updates` to check PyPI for a compatible update manually. NepTrainKit also checks the runtime in the background each time it opens: it stays silent when there is no update or the network check fails, and shows an installation prompt when a new version is available. The wheel's SHA256 is verified and the import and CPU backend are confirmed in a separate process before the version is switched; the update takes effect after restart. If verification fails, the previous version stays in use."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:47 19d04cfdb1214bd49396132881558efb
msgid ""
"通过 pip 安装 NepTrainKit 时，更新后的运行时保存在用户配置目录；Nuitka 独立版则保存在 `NepTrainKit.exe`"
" 旁的 `runtime/nep-adapters/versions`，当前版和上一版会保留用于恢复。"
msgstr ""
"For a pip installation, updated runtimes are stored in the user "
"configuration directory. In a standalone Nuitka build, they are stored "
"next to `NepTrainKit.exe` under `runtime/nep-adapters/versions`; the "
"current and previous versions are retained for recovery."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:49 741e3c7fd1a64040bc0cfcf51ad37b16
msgid "绘图和结构显示"
msgstr "Plots and structure rendering"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:51 81613bc4c95f4213bc81c98be78073a2
#
msgid "`绘图设置` 只影响显示，不改变底层数据。"
msgstr "`Plot Settings` affect presentation only; they do not alter the underlying data."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:53 96567718daea4fb2b792fc9b94a4d09a
msgid "`散点边缘颜色` / `散点填充颜色` / `填充透明度 (0-255)`：散点默认颜色和透明度。"
msgstr "`Scatter edge color` / `Scatter face color` / `Face alpha (0-255)`: default scatter colors and transparency."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:54 df4f10357b2f40248f7cddadf587461e
#
msgid "`PyQtGraph 散点大小` / `VisPy 散点大小` / `VisPy 抗锯齿`：不同画布后端的点大小和抗锯齿。"
msgstr "`PyQtGraph scatter size` / `VisPy scatter size` / `VisPy antialias`: point size and antialiasing for each canvas backend."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:55 888934b008704e218783e0a30fe89976
msgid "`结构背景` / `晶格线颜色`：结构视图背景和晶格线颜色。"
msgstr "`Structure background` / `Lattice line color`: structure-view background and lattice-line colors."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:56 8d3ad69bf9234974a6ba1d7e96a8f7cb
msgid "`选中颜色` / `显示颜色` / `当前标记颜色` / `当前标记大小`：选中点、高亮点和当前结构标记的显示样式。"
msgstr "`Selected color` / `Show color` / `Current marker color` / `Current marker size`: styles for selected points, highlighted points, and the current-structure marker."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:58 4ef56a7c72e34527bf582daf1e9ea1d1
msgid "如果只是想判断结构是否异常，优先调整点大小和当前结构标记；不要为了配色反复改变数据筛选流程。"
msgstr ""
"When the goal is to spot anomalous structures, adjust point size and the "
"current-structure marker first. Do not change the filtering workflow "
"merely to compensate for plot colors."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:60 4b3663f4f208490d91cf1afaef74b01f
msgid "NEP89 和更新"
msgstr "NEP89 and software updates"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:62 5c076fe1707847808e1f01500d0ac08d
#
msgid ""
"`关于 NEP89` 会检查并更新内置 `nep89.txt`。NEP89 "
"可以用于某些候选结构的快速预筛，但它不是所有材料体系的可靠模型。使用时把它当作异常结构筛查工具，不要当作 DFT 标签来源。"
msgstr "`About NEP89` checks for and updates the bundled `nep89.txt`. NEP89 can quickly prescreen candidates for some systems, but it is not reliable for every material system. Treat it as a tool for spotting abnormal structures, not as a source of DFT labels."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:64 5972570ecd6a4d6f85fbccf53b82d580
msgid "如果你有当前体系自己的 NEP 模型，优先使用自己的模型做预筛。"
msgstr ""
"If a NEP model trained for the current system is available, prefer it for"
" prescreening."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:66 a2aa0df785354930a1336d5ce8f3f68e
#
msgid "`关于` 里的 `检查更新` 用于检查 NepTrainKit 新版本。这个检查只影响软件版本提示，不会自动修改你的训练数据。"
msgstr "`Check for Updates` under `About` checks for a newer NepTrainKit release. It only affects the version notification and never modifies your training data."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:68 64a38ad2ef7c494f81198a42062bd590
msgid "修改设置的原则"
msgstr "Guidelines for changing settings"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:70 3db2bebf62c24fd8a41d18c74e72785a
msgid "先确认问题属于显示、读取、预测、导出还是卡片流程，再改对应设置。"
msgstr ""
"First determine whether the problem is in rendering, input, prediction, "
"export, or the card workflow, then change only the corresponding setting."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:71 bb7ce5e284ea4ffdbbf49d8b92234b8b
msgid "一次只改一个关键选项，方便判断影响。"
msgstr "Change one important option at a time so its effect remains attributable."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:72 9502c89ce85a493f9684b20bc6f43267
msgid "涉及数据清洗阈值时，改完要抽查被选中的结构，而不是只看数量变化。"
msgstr ""
"After changing a data-cleaning threshold, inspect some of the selected "
"structures rather than judging the change only by the count."

